.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
dist/
build/
.DS_Store
# forgejo/ live-instance data + API tokens (never committed — ADR-0002)
forgejo/forgejo-data/
forgejo/.token*
# CP-06 spike scratch outputs (curated evidence lives in spike/captures/
# and docs/polar/pi/; these are regenerable run outputs)
spike/rollout_results/
spike/pi-local/node_modules/
spike/pi-local/workspace/
# estate bring-up runtime state written by staging/serving/serve.sh
# (endpoint.env, tunnel.pid) — regenerated every bring-up, never evidence
# (wishlist 12, opened at CP-17 and closed at CP-18)
staging/serving/run/
# CP-48: the development record is untracked (the operator's decision on
# CP-47's classification). The files stay on disk — the operator's copy is
# the only one. The `!` rows ARE the keep list: every negated path is read
# by CI, the release gate, a test suite, or the pins walk (CLASSIFICATION
# §4 rows 1-8, 16-17, re-verified at CP-48), plus CP-48.md — the last
# tracked prompt, the one that records this decision.
docs/prompts/*
!docs/prompts/CP-48.md
docs/reports/
docs/decisions/
docs/AUDIT-2026-08-24.md
docs/CLASSIFICATION.md
docs/golden/*
!docs/golden/mac/
docs/golden/mac/*
!docs/golden/mac/tokens.npz
!docs/golden/mac/MANIFEST.md
!docs/golden/mac/record.json
docs/polar/*
!docs/polar/pi-corpus/
docs/polar/pi-corpus/*
!docs/polar/pi-corpus/callback_session_result.json
!docs/polar/pi-corpus/trace.json
!docs/polar/fidelity/
docs/polar/fidelity/*
!docs/polar/fidelity/callback_session_result.json
!docs/polar/fidelity/trace.json
!docs/polar/h200-fidelity/
docs/polar/h200-fidelity/*
